<title>TAJIKISTAN: Tajik GDP rises 4.7 pct in Jan-Feb from year ago.</title>
<headline>Tajik GDP rises 4.7 pct in Jan-Feb from year ago.</headline>
<dateline>DUSHANBE 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tajikistan's gross domestic product in first two months calendar 1997 totalled 34.637 billion Tajik roubles, up 4.7 percent from a year earlier in inflation-adjusted terms, the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>    TAJIK GDP			   Jan-Feb 97   Jan-Feb 96</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	  +4.7	    n/a</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
